`pkgs.formats.hocon` uses `pyhocon` to validate generated HOCON, but `pyhocon` does not implement classpath includes. Therefore, configurations using `classpath` includes fail validation even though classpath includes are valid HOCON syntax.

Use either:

```nix
pkgs.formats.hocon {
  doCheck = false;
}
```

or provide an alternative validator via the `validator` option:

```nix
pkgs.formats.hocon {
  validator = alternativeValidator;
}
```

The documentation specifically recommends one of these approaches for classpath includes.
